  "description": "A quick update for 2 Stocks that just broke out...",
  "body_html": "<p>Sorry for 2 emails in a day, but I don’t control the markets. </p><p><strong>1st:</strong> If you didn’t see this morning’s <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-update-a-subtle-clue?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Update, you can watch this here.</a>. Also cover a stock that I strongly speculate will be going through an acquisition which will likely result in a 20% to 40% pop in stock price. </p><p><strong>2nd:</strong> We have already talked about these 2 companies before but I am seeking entry for <em><strong>TODAY</strong></em>…</p>",
